{
  "id": "section-keep-track-of-ammo",
  "paragraphs": [
    {
      "id": "section-keep-track-of-ammo:p0000",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Keep Track of Ammo\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[31,211,230]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-keep-track-of-ammo:p0001",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "You must keep track of how many\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[31,230,262]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-keep-track-of-ammo:p0002",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "bullets/arrows/shotgun shells you\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[31,262,296]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-keep-track-of-ammo:p0003",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "have with each ranged weapon.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[31,296,326]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-keep-track-of-ammo:p0004",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "You may NOT use a weapon’s\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[31,326,353]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-keep-track-of-ammo:p0005",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "ammo with another weapon,\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[31,353,379]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-keep-track-of-ammo:p0006",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "unless the weapons are exactly the\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[31,379,414]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-keep-track-of-ammo:p0007",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "same. Here are the different ammo\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[31,414,448]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-keep-track-of-ammo:p0008",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "types paired with their weapons.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[31,448,481]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-keep-track-of-ammo:p0009",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Note: these are game terms only\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[31,481,513]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-keep-track-of-ammo:p0010",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "and do not reflect the reality of\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[31,513,547]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-keep-track-of-ammo:p0011",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "firearms.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[31,547,557]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-keep-track-of-ammo:p0012",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "● Pistols use bullets\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[31,557,579]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-keep-track-of-ammo:p0013",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "● Rifles use rifle bullets\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[31,579,606]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-keep-track-of-ammo:p0014",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "● Crossbows use bolts\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[31,606,628]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-keep-track-of-ammo:p0015",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "● Bows use arrows\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[31,628,646]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-keep-track-of-ammo:p0016",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "● Shotguns use shells\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[31,646,668]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-keep-track-of-ammo:p0017",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "● Thrown knives use knives\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[31,668,695]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-keep-track-of-ammo:p0018",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "To keep track of ammo, use\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[31,695,722]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-keep-track-of-ammo:p0019",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "differently colored counters (dice,\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[31,722,758]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-keep-track-of-ammo:p0020",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "glass beads, etc.) for each weapon.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[31,758,794]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-keep-track-of-ammo:p0021",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "It sounds complicated, but in reality\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[31,794,832]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-keep-track-of-ammo:p0022",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "you will be using just one weapon\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[31,832,866]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-keep-track-of-ammo:p0023",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "most of the time. If you do not have\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[31,866,903]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-keep-track-of-ammo:p0024",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "any appropriate tokens,  just cross\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[31,903,939]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-keep-track-of-ammo:p0025",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "off squares on a piece of paper.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[31,939,972]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-keep-track-of-ammo:p0026",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "You may feel that it is\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[31,972,996]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-keep-track-of-ammo:p0027",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "unrealistic that a single bullet\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[31,996,1029]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-keep-track-of-ammo:p0028",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "or arrow can cause the death\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[31,1029,1058]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-keep-track-of-ammo:p0029",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "of multiple enemies. This\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[31,1058,1084]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-keep-track-of-ammo:p0030",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "happens especially when you\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[31,1084,1112]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-keep-track-of-ammo:p0031",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "roll a 6 (an “explosion”). Did\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[31,1112,1143]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-keep-track-of-ammo:p0032",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "the single bullet go through\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[31,1143,1172]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-keep-track-of-ammo:p0033",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "the head of 4 zombies that\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[31,1172,1199]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-keep-track-of-ammo:p0034",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "were just standing in line?\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[31,1199,1227]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-keep-track-of-ammo:p0035",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Certainly not. We are not\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[31,1227,1253]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-keep-track-of-ammo:p0036",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "counting each single bullet\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[31,1253,1281]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-keep-track-of-ammo:p0037",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "used but a “finite amount of\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[31,1281,1310]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-keep-track-of-ammo:p0038",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "bullets in game terms”. So, for\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[31,1310,1342]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-keep-track-of-ammo:p0039",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "example, when an assault\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[31,1342,1367]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-keep-track-of-ammo:p0040",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "rifle performs 2 attacks in a\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[31,1367,1397]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-keep-track-of-ammo:p0041",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "turn and uses up 3 ammo, the\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[31,1397,1426]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-keep-track-of-ammo:p0042",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "rifle didn’t fire exactly 3\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[31,1426,1454]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-keep-track-of-ammo:p0043",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "bullets. That number is just\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[31,1454,1483]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-keep-track-of-ammo:p0044",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "an abstract way to keep track\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[31,1483,1513]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-keep-track-of-ammo:p0045",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "of a consumable resource.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[31,1513,1539]]"
    }
  ],
  "sourcePages": [
    31
  ]
}
